#                      [[architecture-shards-as-substrate-source]],
#                      [[feedback-rust-delivers-primitives-substrate-delivers-composition]],
#                      [[feedback-alex-ratification-overrides-mara-lean-unless-hard-technical]].
#
# Karen ancestor citations (at introduction sites per anti-theft convention):
#   - Chamseddine, Ali H.; Connes, Alain, *Why the Standard Model?*,
#     arXiv:0706.3688, 2007. — almost-commutative spectral triple
#     admissibility inherited through F_X.
#   - von Foerster, Heinz, *Ethics and Second-Order Cybernetics*
#     (essay-titled-thus republished 1990s; imperative statement traces
#     to *Understanding Understanding* volume 1974/2003). — the gauge
#     each F_X preserves is Foerster's ethical imperative rendered as
#     compile-time invariant.
#
# Related shards:
#   - `shards/code.mirror` (sibling family-root at grammar-at-an-altitude
#     discipline; renames into @facet during Phase 3 cascade)
#   - `shards/cast.mirror` (sibling prism at peer-to-peer translation
#     mesh altitude; composes @glue + @fate under the hood)
#   - `shards/mcp/serve.mirror` (cf8b21b; exemplar composition-shard
#     body shape @facet/X species will follow)
#   - `shards/beam/system.mirror` (@beam/system with Baez-Schreiber
#     principal-bundle-tower; @facet/beam will compose over)
#   - `shards/mirror/store/git.mirror` (@mirror/store/git;
#     @facet/git will compose over)
#   - `shards/glue.mirror` + `shards/fate.mirror` (primitives
#     @cast composes over)
#
# Path-namespace property: this file at `shards/facet.mirror` declares
# `@facet` as the universal generation-surface family-root; species
# live at `shards/facet/<name>.mirror`.
#
# === substrate-truth (2026-08-21 mint) ===
#
# At mint time, `@facet` is a virgin family-root with zero landed
# species. Phase 3 rename cascade migrates the 11 landed `@code/*`
# species. Phase 4 T-91-16 discharge authors `@facet/rust` forward-
# projection body via first-file iterative (starting `rust/src/wire.rs`
# at 210 LOC per Seam Phase D `1893afc` SHARPENING-3). @facet/git +
# @facet/mirror + @facet/lustre + @facet/nix + @facet/docker + @facet/fly
# species mint as cascade discharges.

out @facet
